{"id":"obrashchenie","lemma":"обращение","pos":"noun","rank":3390,"glosses":["conversion, transformation","circulation","treatment, management, handling"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"обращения","plural":"обращения"},"examples":[{"text":"Он имеет право на лучшее обращение.","en":"He is entitled to better treatment.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have, to possess","l":"иметь"},{"g":"right"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"something better"},null]},{"text":"Надеюсь, что вы примите моё обращение.","en":"I hope that you'll accept my request.","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to take","l":"принять"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Том не заслуживал такого обращения.","en":"Tom didn't deserve to be treated that way.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Чем я заслужил такое обращение?","en":"What did I do to deserve such treatment?","words":[{"g":"than"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to deserve","l":"заслужить"},{"g":"something like that"},null]},{"text":"Они против жестокого обращения с животными.","en":"They're against animal abuse.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"against"},null,null,{"g":"with / from"},null]}]}